WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:12.000
A worker bends and reaches toward the surface of an unfinished pitched roof with a handheld tool, briefly straightening between movements. Timber framing, neighboring houses, trees, and sky surround the roof.

00:12.000 --> 00:16.000
The worker stands more upright and takes short steps across the slope to another working position, then bends toward the roof again.

00:16.000 --> 00:24.000
Remaining in a low working posture, the worker repeatedly reaches toward the roof surface with the tool and adjusts their stance.

00:24.000 --> 00:28.000
The worker straightens, pauses, and takes a few steps to reposition on the pitched roof.

00:28.000 --> 00:35.836
The worker bends and lowers into a deeper crouch, then continues reaching and working near the roof plane. This self-recorded field video provides context for the study.
